=== B52 red on the base bundles (59c863c): the return's fee is PREDICTED, the hosts pin no shape, and the doc verifies on the wrong basis
PASS k1-red-predicted-fee the base plan predicts the fee from the source count (5,000 x max(2, 3) = 15,000) and pays 80000 of 95000 — the tool's real fee for the cross-pool sweep is 25,000, so every host's build then dies untyped (P2-1's wall): {"amount_zats":"80000","fee_zats":"15000","kind":"payout","party":"reserve-return","remaining_zats":"95000"}
PASS k2-red-change-candidate-approved the base hosts APPROVE the candidate that leaves 5,000 zats behind as change (the only shape check is input_zats) — the money would move and the kept accounting then throws post-broadcast: exit 0, approval recorded
PASS k3-red-plans-the-unsweepable-sweep the base plan PLANS the return over the note the tool cannot spend (its prediction counts the Sapling note): {"amount_zats":"37000","fee_zats":"20000","kind":"payout","party":"reserve-return","remaining_zats":"57000"} — every host's build then dies untyped
PASS k4-red-doctored-verifies the base verifies a doctored accounting ((remaining, fee) +5,000 with a fifth "source") — B51's inputs.length tie locks in the wrong basis: exit 0
RESULT PASS
